# Torvus Bog 0g_swamp_hall layer 3: CPlantScarabSwarm e0c1e00b6 (uid in `obj` varies per boot).
# psc5: god-mode player stands beside the swarm so real boids take attack slots (natural arms), then
# three phases for the arms the plain fight leaves: (a) the swarm moved under the floor, so the boids'
# tiny space-above box meets solid geometry (cpp:108's space test false); (b) back to the fight spot;
# (c) Deactivate so a Think call runs with GetActive()==0 (cpp:86).  1200 frames, fast.
@f220 layer 3
@f300 god 1; give morphBall 1; give boostBall 1; give missile 250; give chargeBeam 1; give darkBeam 1; give lightBeam 1; fastmorph 1
@f380 send e001e00b6 Activate
@f420 tp -153.0 -66.0 37.0
@f600 obj e001e00b6
@f640 tp -153.0 -70.5 37.0
@f680 place e001e00b6 player 4
@f800 obj e001e00b6
@f900 tp -153.0 -66.0 37.0
@f940 place e001e00b6 player 5
@f1000 obj e001e00b6
@f1060 send e001e00b6 Deactivate
@f1120 obj e001e00b6
@f1150 send e001e00b6 Activate
@f1190 obj e001e00b6
